{"id":"n67896-3-3","stage":0,"title":"새로 · 凌晨","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67896-3-3-1","ko":"새로 한 시에 만나자.","zh":"凌晨一点见吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"凌晨（过午夜）","explanation":"새로：此处是“过了午夜十二点”，所以 새로 한 시 是“凌晨一点”；日常还可说 새벽 한 시，不要把这里的 새로 理解为“重新”。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"3","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"시에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시에","audio":"/audio/d114a7f7c3eca4fa0970.mp3"}},{"text":"만나자.","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나자","audio":"/audio/db87772a2bc5c2996a99.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"凌晨、过了午夜十二点","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"过了午夜十二点后；此处指凌晨。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2c7a3c410c6471822b90.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67896-3-3-2","ko":"알았어. 이따 봐.","zh":"知道了，待会儿见。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"好、知道了","explanation":"알다：这里是对见面提议的应答，알았어 相当于“好，知道了”，不是说刚学到新知识。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}},{"text":"이따","meaning":"稍后，回头","explanation":"이따：稍后，回头。","readings":[{"term":"이따","audio":"/audio/47b7085f8116ec397859.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72088","senseId":"1","lemma":"이따","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이따","audio":"/audio/47b7085f8116ec397859.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道了、答应","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"接受对方的提议或要求；这里表示“好，知道了”。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"47b7085f8116ec39","term":"이따","zh":"稍后，回头","audio":"/audio/47b7085f8116ec397859.mp3","entryId":"72088","definition":"过一会儿时间以后。","pronunciation":["이따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f44b94b71dc5f9e94eb4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.337,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67896","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":